      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef medianUniqueness(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    total_subarrays = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    target_idx = (total_subarrays + 1) // 2\n\n    def count_subarrays_with_at_most(distinct_limit, nums):\n        count = 0\n        left = 0\n        freq = {}\n        distinct_count = 0\n\n        for right in range(len(nums)):\n            val = nums[right]\n            if val not in freq:\n                distinct_count += 1\n                freq[val] = 0\n            freq[val] += 1\n\n            while distinct_count > distinct_limit:\n                left_val = nums[left]\n                freq[left_val] -= 1\n                if freq[left_val] == 0:\n                    del freq[left_val]\n                    distinct_count -= 1\n                left += 1\n\n            count += right - left + 1\n\n        return count\n\n    low = 1\n    high = n\n    ans = n\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if count_subarrays_with_at_most(mid, nums) >= target_idx:\n            ans = mid\n            high = mid - 1\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n\n    return ans\n```",
