    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "For dynamic similarity in open channel flows involving gravity and inertia, the Froude number must be preserved. Since the model is at 1:20 scale, the head scales linearly, so model head = 20 m / 20 = 1 m. Discharge scales with the 5/2 power of linear scale ratio: $ Q_p = Q_m \\times (L_r)^{5/2} = 0.5 \\times (20)^{5/2} = 0.5 \\times 20^{2.5} = 0.5 \\times 1788.85 \\approx 894.4 \\, \\text{m}^3/\\text{s} $.\n\nThus, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{E}",
