{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "openai/gpt-4o",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Dickson McCunn decides to break into a home. Initially hesitant to break the law, he ironically finds entering through a veranda more acceptable than using the coal-hole, which highlights his social conditioning and evolves his decision to take action against the foreign conspirators. Thus, despite his initial reluctance, he resolves to join the effort by invading the space. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Dickson McCunn}}",
