    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3.5-9b",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "According to the context, Luke is helped by guidance from Obi-Wan's spirit during the battle. This spiritual intervention allows him to use the Force effectively. Therefore, Obi-Wan's spirit is what guides Luke to destroy the Death Star.\n\n\\boxed{Obi-Wan's spirit}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 876,
