roject Gutenberg Literary\nArchive Foundation, how to help produce our new eBooks, and how to\nsubscribe to our email newsletter to hear about new eBooks.\n\n\nQuestion: What does \"In pace requiescat\" mean?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\"In pace requiescat\" is a Latin phrase meaning \"May he rest in peace.\"\n\nIt is the final line of \"The Cask of Amontillado,\" spoken by the narrator Montresor about his victim, Fortunato, whom he has just entombed alive.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{May he rest in peace}}",
      "success": true,
