    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The passage satirizes Leibniz's optimistic philosophy, making Voltaire's critique closest to Hume’s skepticism toward rationalist metaphysics and dogmatic systems.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{A}",
